drives.

It uses, without copying them here, the following Apache-2.0 works, which the
external-suites workflow checks out at run time:
  - SEAMWARE/coraine, test/funcTests (the cases and corTestFunctions.sh),
    Copyright 2026 Seamware
  - SEAMWARE/corLibs and SEAMWARE/corTest (corTest, corDiff, corJson,
    corTestClient), Copyright Seamware

antares.sh replaces four functions of Coraine's corTestFunctions.sh
(coraineStart, coraineStop, corDbDrop, corTroeInit/corTroeDrop) with
functions of the same names that drive Antares instead; compare.py
reimplements corDiff's REGEX() matching rule.
